Unused endpoints that need a home:

GET /accounts/acctId (get acc info)

GET /accounts/:acctId/games/:gameId/players (Get all players in game)

GET /accounts/:acctId/games/:gameId/die (Get all dice in game)

GET/accounts/:acctId/games/:gameId/die/:dieId (Get a single die)

GET /accounts/:acctId/games/:gameId/diceSet (Get all dice sets in a game)

Get /accounts/:acctId/games/:gameId/diceSet/:diceSetId (Get a single dice set)


ManageGamesPage fetches entire game from Get/accounts/:acctId/games/:gameId, fetch above independent of this